  "Installed. It takes effect the next time Ventic starts.": "Kuruldu. Ventic'in bir sonraki açılışında etkili olur.",
  "It tells most while moving around with a remote, which is where the fades stack up: on the television this was measured on, that went from 3 frames a second to 23. It starts on there, and off everywhere else.": "En çok, uzaktan kumandayla gezinirken belli eder; geçiş efektleri asıl orada üst üste biner: bunun ölçüldüğü televizyonda saniyedeki kare sayısı 3'ten 23'e çıktı. Orada açık başlar, başka her yerde kapalı.",
  "It was the fall that killed him.\nNot the drop — the sudden stop.": "Onu öldüren düşüştü.\nDüşmek değil — ani duruş.",
  "Its channels will appear under Live TV. A playlist link usually carries your account details, so it is kept out of backups.": "TODO_TRANSLATION: Its channels will appear under Live TV. A playlist link usually carries your account details, so it is kept out of backups.",
